{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "66f50b31d14c9931ce0e8e52fb26b9d1b8fb3408e157efe9e8c51da9f50f724b", "ja": "機械仕掛けの蠢動", "zh": "机械装置的蠢动", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e5dae3ee344d598e6996d1703ad0363a58192dc83cdb3ec397a2522a31b40dbd", "ja": "タマキは衛兵として機械都市に潜り込んで\nいた。彼女の目的は高性能ロボットに拉致\nされた恩人、アカネの救出だった。\n一方メグミたちはミナコと親交を深めていき\n彼が王家の人間であることを知る。", "zh": "环作为卫兵潜入了机械都市。  \n她的目的是救出被高性能机器人绑架的恩人茜。  \n另一方面，惠美她们逐渐与美奈子加深交情，并得知他是王室成员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1000_robottoheisi", "source_sha256": "0222aac5b634e53c15abc8f64f971122b8da411c137fc0e39b02e059edb72950", "ja": "おまえは東地区の警備にあたれ。気を抜くなよ、人間。", "zh": "你负责东区的警戒。别放松警惕，人类。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "05f1fd85c3b13c97307926f0d8193a16e69ce46b0bf853c55ad33e96abbe56f5", "ja": "は！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "9c6c683fc71f272ce4b52ef7915693882d98c48f2d96edbb636244bc0ab2af48", "ja": "（……人間じゃ下っ端にしかなれない。\nだけどやっとこの機械都市に入り込めたんだ）", "zh": "（……人类只能当最底层的喽啰。可是，我终于还是混进这座机械都市了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "e151271c7c16ee71b2da525cb6fc970bc8f74214fee90eca968e442c8ff5a851", "ja": "（この都市のどこかに、アカネはいる。\n必ず、見つけ出さなきゃ）", "zh": "（这座城市的某个地方，茜一定就在那儿。我一定得把她找出来）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "c94040ba1a6acbcc09cd7a8d200d3d9b2002fdbd547fd02ed7e9c9254e4fc8a5", "ja": "（……孤児だった私とセリカを、拾ってくれたアカネ。\n家に住まわせてくれて、稼ぎ方を教えてくれて）", "zh": "（……茜收留了当时还是孤儿的我和星梨花。让我们住进家里，还教我们怎么赚钱）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "ada01fff9222d6e0c334e88ec1abc220bca3ea989ed65a7be218c88fd9fc6406", "ja": "（だけどある時、街にやってきたロボットたちが\nアカネを無理やり連れて行ってしまった）", "zh": "（可是有一天，来到街上的机器人们，强行把茜带走了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "a1d5f84c865aa6b781dc82d689ff71e9acd19ad65df022b4b727351e2f65a0e4", "ja": "「タマキ、これを！」", "zh": "「环，给你这个！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "0be457d269547def74fdb237ccd462f7f3f87c3a161b2a1d6a83cd6169a590fb", "ja": "「！　この石はなに？」", "zh": "「！　这块石头是什么？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "267d2c5b7f5ee0b7bc458c893d21fe97e30ef98d18e5265461b2efcc99a4ded1", "ja": "「奴らはこれがなきゃ私に手出しできない。\n誰にも見せないで。隠してて！」", "zh": "「没有这个，那些家伙就没法对我下手。\n别给任何人看。藏好了！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "9abe8e24ac14ec6b897540f81d76688779f4f7f8eb5fa783ba4da74f5f89fcee", "ja": "（……アカネはずっと古い研究をしてた。奴らの目的が\nそれなら、アカネは生きてる。たぶんマツリの近くで）", "zh": "（……茜一直在研究古代的东西。如果他们的目的是这个，那茜还活着。大概就在小祭身边）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "7c15912a737d790893628d474ade8d0b2a6f39a0e711e5014c7df24871353066", "ja": "（セリカ、心配しないで。協力者もできたし、\nきっとアカネを助け出して、一緒に帰るから……）", "zh": "（星梨花，别担心。我已经有帮手了，\n一定会把茜救出来，和她一起回去的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1011_hinatarobo", "source_sha256": "6bbd00b094c5ec7137813082b0e70786e3efd12461c2e2379336bc65d43cc0ba", "ja": "……ピピ……ピピピ。", "zh": "……哔哔……哔哔哔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "901aa916a6859e61cd5eadbac90b64ba011ba099e8748d8dab849c81506858d8", "ja": "お茶？　ありがと、ヒナタロボ♪", "zh": "茶？谢谢你，小日向机器人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "2528b0c19a27fe91ef7747a70ea656d9af38b8621695f82adc3ef879f269bf5f", "ja": "ロボットが、お茶を淹れてる……。", "zh": "机器人正在泡茶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "fa602eab9ee3a436eba7cf276ba4c8ffe60c89556033225aee6e42a8a8fba54e", "ja": "なに？　ヒナタロボが気になる？", "zh": "怎么？你对日向机器人感兴趣？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "f0e6bdfb88cb2bd08dca0418e49b0829050b4ece7d54f2c601d268e69dc1fa30", "ja": "こんなに仕事ができるなんて、すごいなと思って。\n普通は命じられたことしかできないですよね？", "zh": "能做到这么多工作，我觉得真是太厉害了。\n一般来说，机器人只能完成被吩咐的事情吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5de00126fe6dc824eddec0487b253d385c5601ef4b7a2080e22504775093d1f3", "ja": "ヒナタロボは優秀なんですよ！\nまあ、造ったのは私ですけど♪", "zh": "日向机器人可是很优秀的哦！\n不过嘛，毕竟是我造的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1017_hinatarobo", "source_sha256": "1b8a0dfbb33ff28f04de4fdb16d77c7a7239c4b25d66652523a8b73fec0fe9d3", "ja": "ピー……ピピピ♪", "zh": "哔……哔哔哔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "1f93854c3dd9e30305bb5cba7ff9ac325f476e8b581eaf9d2312676c785f89a3", "ja": "おー。褒められて喜んでる。", "zh": "哦——被夸了之后很开心嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "9d07e1c335ac79196aa4d505ced3802912ef52a613fca4502292159e65a2aa03", "ja": "……。モモコもほめて。", "zh": "……。也要夸夸桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "52b10f661643daf99ab2b3adb56474bed1c87a5ade6440bd6956c437ce9471de", "ja": "いや、あんたは何もしてないじゃん？", "zh": "不是，你根本什么都没做吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9513f3d3b83604166217f956e263abbe414c3c4a4896efa26b8a63a2e8126991", "ja": "物を壊さないだけ、メグミよりマシだと\n思いますけどねー。", "zh": "至少我不会弄坏东西，我觉得比惠好一点吧——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "af2713570055069139c4336b544c053f62041d844b6700dc1cacce33bbcab73c", "ja": "アタシだって好きで壊してるんじゃないよ～。\n不可抗力！", "zh": "我也不是故意要弄坏的呀～。\n这是不可抗力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0fc6a8a26b069fca1f564ca613368f8e231ea8ba2f9b9a0e2671a5f784243afc", "ja": "多すぎなんですぅ！", "zh": "实在太多了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "ae2bd452d50983cf1d00272d49dc1a91e487fc152025c0d701b9a9897a9ef5e7", "ja": "……、いいな……。", "zh": "……真好啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "4f724618b1e18b4d4d3308158ad546fb4f152947c6b54772bae3f47ec14be6d1", "ja": "ふふっ、よーし。\nセリカ、僕たちも友達になろっか！", "zh": "嘻嘻，好——。星梨花，我们也做朋友吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "cc1a76302a43389154db96412647572ae1fefdc1627317b1c0d01fc81bdd59d0", "ja": "え？　き、急になんですか？\n私は別に、そんな……。", "zh": "诶？怎、怎么突然这么说？\n我也没什么，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "3226e5e1ea099824f08edd749390c4fca35f41c498050b660b73e638e12882b4", "ja": "モモコもなる。", "zh": "桃子也要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "ee396a407035901820c268f6df557fd63cd3aeda140c43bc939260c9cd1cafb2", "ja": "おっ、いいね！\nじゃあ3人で、友情の握手だ！", "zh": "哦，不错嘛！\n那就3个人来握个友谊之手吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "1c1605d769dfac34369dc83474700a6b3e88a650f6c75b103edb2f66ac495da2", "ja": "……。悪いやつじゃ、ないのかもね？", "zh": "……你也许不是坏人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1030_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e0011f48bd0fa111e7b7c8e0b6994eb9122108fe6364d81c330e309688eeb1f8", "ja": "うん。本当に王家の人間だとしたら……。", "zh": "嗯，如果真的是王室成员的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "8050dd0ae7f8399340f5df0289ea1c3234f38bac534ddf76d3405b10021e15e7", "ja": "マツリを倒すってのも……\n本気なのかも。", "zh": "说要打倒茉莉这件事……可能也是认真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "3304487d9f933e13376527fe3d4819b06cb0bb5e90f2370355167c5088de6faf", "ja": "……来たか。『陽天の日』の式典で、マツリはいよいよ\n王を退位させるつもりだ。新たにロボットの王が立つ。", "zh": "……你来了吗。『阳天之日』的典礼上，茉莉终于\n打算让国王退位了。届时将由新的机器人之王登基。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "1765dac474534a954ac6dec4f804f2755e1b224adc4b47fe039bfb89e476bba9", "ja": "国王を！？　あいつら、どこまで人間から\n奪う気なんだ！", "zh": "国王！？　那些家伙到底还要从人类手里夺走多少东西啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "1e9f605e57d37d18d32f8ab2949a706c62aa16359b67a841bd59311519e8ce28", "ja": "決行するなら今しかない。\n君に……『君たち』に、その覚悟はあるか？", "zh": "要付诸行动就只有现在了。\n你……“你们”，做好这个觉悟了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1035_040tam", "source_sha256": "89230481a9f43595ec93ed88c6ddf0dd38b03020ac1908eee32313c68831eef8", "ja": "当たり前だ。お前こそ、覚悟を決めてくれ。\nマツリの顔を知ってるのは、お前だけなんだ。", "zh": "那是当然。倒是你，做好觉悟吧。\n毕竟见过茉莉长相的，就只有你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0398_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_04_1036_021mat", "source_sha256": "642e6d05d2c5c85d0295a6e0a305fb6ec82cf6dce249fd4da6addc8c7d0a47c1", "ja": "……もちろん。約束しよう。\n必ずロボットたちを屈服させる、と。", "zh": "……当然。我向你保证。\n定会让那些机器人臣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
